{"s": {"beats": [], "code": "doc = thing(\"document\", x=-3.2, h=3.2, color=CREAM)\nenter(doc, \"draw\")\ncamera(zoom=1.3, to=(-3.2, 0.2))\nsfx(\"pop\")\n\nwhen(\"buyout contracts\")\nstamp = thing(\"lock\", x=-3.2, h=1.8, color=CREAM)\nenter(stamp, \"draw\")\nlabel(stamp, \"BUYOUT\")\ncamera(zoom=1.35, to=(-3.2, 0.2))\n\nwhen(\"slice of the game's profits\")\npie_slice = thing(\"pie\", x=-2.5, h=3.2, share=0.25, color=CREAM)\nenter(pie_slice, \"draw\")\ncamera(zoom=1.25, to=(-2.5, 0.2))\n\nwhen(\"around $1,000 per 4-hour session\")\ncamera(zoom=1.0, to=(0.1, 0.2))\nclock_obj = thing(\"clock\", x=2.8, h=2.8, color=CREAM)\nenter(clock_obj, \"draw\")\nrate = text(\"$0\", x=2.8, y=2.3, style=\"number\", color=CREAM)\nplay(Create(rate), run_time=0.5, sound=\"tick\")\ncount(rate, to=1000, frm=0, prefix=\"$\", dur=1.0)\n", "duration": 14.3, "narration": "In video games, voice and motion-capture actors usually sign buyout contracts. Instead of taking a slice of the game's profits, they get paid a flat union day rate\u2014often around $1,000 per 4-hour session.", "objects": [{"id": "n0", "obj": "document"}, {"id": "n1", "obj": "lock"}, {"id": "n2", "obj": "pie"}, {"id": "n3", "obj": "clock"}], "theme": "visual", "words": [["In", 0.0], ["video", 0.3], ["games,", 0.56], ["voice", 1.38], ["and", 1.66], ["motion-capture", 1.98], ["actors", 2.68], ["usually", 3.1], ["sign", 3.5], ["buyout", 3.88], ["contracts.", 4.36], ["Instead", 5.62], ["of", 5.82], ["taking", 6.0], ["a", 6.26], ["slice", 6.48], ["of", 6.66], ["the", 6.9], ["game's", 6.96], ["profits,", 7.32], ["they", 8.16], ["get", 8.2], ["paid", 8.38], ["a", 8.64], ["flat", 8.82], ["union", 9.06], ["day", 9.4], ["rate\u2014often", 9.68], ["around", 10.54], ["$1,000", 10.92], ["per", 11.8], ["4-hour", 12.16], ["session.", 12.64]]}, "script": 1, "v": true}